[
  {
    "kind": "page",
    "id": "drv",
    "text": "",
    "children": [
      {
        "kind": "title",
        "id": "",
        "text": "本机概况",
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "id": "",
        "text": "1401 可在运行 macOS 15.5 及更新版本或 macOS 26 Tahoe 的 OpenCore 电脑上安装 NullMoth 驱动。**请保持用于启动本机的 OpenCore U 盘或磁盘连接**：1401 会修改该盘上的配置。",
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "kind": "machine",
        "id": "",
        "text": "",
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "kind": "verdict",
        "id": "verdict",
        "text": "",
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "kind": "card",
        "id": "steps",
        "text": "",
        "children": [
          {
            "kind": "subtitle",
            "id": "",
            "text": "操作步骤",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "steps",
            "id": "",
            "text": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "kind": "step",
                "id": "s1",
                "text": "**获取驱动。**",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "kind": "status",
                    "id": "s1t",
                    "text": "",
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "button",
                    "id": "dl",
                    "text": "下载驱动",
                    "children": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "status",
                    "id": "dlp",
                    "text": "",
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "step",
                "id": "s2",
                "text": "**先查看更改。**1401 会读取 OpenCore 配置并列出准备进行的每项更改，此时不会修改任何内容。（macOS 会询问密码。）",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "kind": "button",
                    "id": "dry",
                    "text": "查看更改",
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "step",
                "id": "s3",
                "text": "**安装。**备份 OpenCore 配置，执行列出的更改，安装驱动，并在启动选择器中添加 *1401: Remove NVIDIA driver*。",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "kind": "button",
                    "id": "go",
                    "text": "安装驱动",
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "step",
                "id": "s4",
                "text": "**重新启动。**如果 macOS 提示系统扩展被阻止，请打开[隐私与安全性](action://priv)，点击“允许”，然后再次重启。",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "kind": "button",
                    "id": "rs",
                    "text": "立即重启",
                    "children": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "kind": "efiPicker",
            "id": "efirow",
            "text": "无法确认启动分区。请选择本机启动时使用的 OpenCore 分区：",
            "children": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "card",
        "id": "logwrap",
        "text": "",
        "children": [
          {
            "kind": "subtitle",
            "id": "",
            "text": "1401 的操作记录",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "",
            "text": "[打开日志文件夹](action://logs)",
            "children": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "card",
        "id": "",
        "text": "",
        "children": [
          {
            "kind": "subtitle",
            "id": "",
            "text": "更新",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "",
            "text": "1401 会检查最新版 NullMoth 驱动和 1401 App。App 会自行更新并重新打开。驱动下载后会校验发布的 SHA-256，再按上述相同流程安装，并先备份 OpenCore 配置。",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "",
            "text": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "kind": "button",
                "id": "updchk",
                "text": "检查更新",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "button",
                "id": "upddrv",
                "text": "更新驱动",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "button",
                "id": "updapp",
                "text": "更新 App",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "status",
                "id": "updr",
                "text": "",
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "",
            "text": "**提前更新。**新驱动会先推送给启用此选项的用户，确认其电脑未出现退步后再向所有人提供。启用后可提前一两天获取版本，\n遇到问题时请发送日志。",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "",
            "text": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "kind": "button",
                "id": "earlyon",
                "text": "开启提前更新",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "button",
                "id": "earlyoff",
                "text": "关闭提前更新",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "status",
                "id": "earlyr",
                "text": "",
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "card",
        "id": "",
        "text": "",
        "children": [
          {
            "kind": "subtitle",
            "id": "",
            "text": "升级到 macOS 26 Tahoe",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "",
            "text": "在 macOS 15 中，**准备升级到 Tahoe**会安装或更新驱动、暂时停用它，并为安装器设置可显示画面所需的小型 GPU BAR。随后在“软件更新”中安装 macOS 26。首次启动会配置 Tahoe 驱动并自动重启一次；**取消准备**可恢复原有设置。",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "",
            "text": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "kind": "button",
                "id": "upd",
                "text": "准备升级到 Tahoe",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "button",
                "id": "swu",
                "text": "打开软件更新",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "button",
                "id": "updc",
                "text": "取消 Tahoe 升级准备",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "status",
                "id": "updt",
                "text": "",
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "card",
        "id": "",
        "text": "",
        "children": [
          {
            "kind": "subtitle",
            "id": "",
            "text": "如果重启后出现问题",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "",
            "text": "在 OpenCore 启动选择器中选择 **1401: Remove NVIDIA driver**，再选 macOS 磁盘。1401 会移除驱动并重启，恢复安装前的电脑与 OpenCore 配置。屏幕可能要等第二次重启后才会亮起。",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "",
            "text": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "kind": "button",
                "id": "rm",
                "text": "移除驱动",
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
